200-    - At each step, exactly one cardinal direction from the head has reachable
201-      markers (on a half-line: same row or column); the sprite advances to the
202-      nearest one.
203-    - On reaching a marker, consume it; sprite re-faces that direction.
204-    - Repeat until no markers remain; output the final sprite position on a clean bg.
205-
206-    Key insight: The triangle's tip encodes facing direction, which sets marker-consumption priority.
207-    """
